---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Button from '../../components/Button.astro';

const articleSchema = JSON.stringify([
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "Article",
    "headline": "High-Quality 3D Signs in Zirakpur & Panchkula",
    "author": { "@type": "Organization", "name": "Classic Printing" },
    "publisher": { "@type": "Organization", "name": "Classic Printing" },
    "datePublished": "2026-07-20"
  },
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
    "itemListElement": [
      { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Home", "item": "https://3dsign.in/" },
      { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "Blog", "item": "https://3dsign.in/blog" },
      { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 3, "name": "High-Quality 3D Signs in Zirakpur & Panchkula" }
    ]
  }
]);
---

<Layout 
  title="High-Quality 3D Signs in Zirakpur & Panchkula"
  description="Upgrade your corporate office reception in Zirakpur and Panchkula with premium 3D sign boards and metallic letters from Classic Printing. Call 7976169388!"
  schema={articleSchema}
  
>
  {/* Hero Section */}
  <section class="bg-[var(--color-light-surface)] pt-32 pb-20 border-b border-gray-200">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 text-center">
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mb-6">
        High-Quality 3D Signs in <span class="text-neon-blue text-glow animate-flicker">Zirakpur & Panchkula</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 mb-10">
        Premium metallic and acrylic 3D lettering for corporate offices and luxury retail. Elevate your brand identity.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-center gap-4">
        <Button href="tel:7976169388" variant="blue-solid">Call Now: 7976169388</Button>
        <Button href="/contact" variant="secondary">Request a Quote</Button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {/* Content */}
  <section class="py-20 max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4">
    <div class="prose prose-lg text-gray-600 prose-headings:text-gray-900 prose-a:text-neon-blue hover:prose-a:text-neon-pink max-w-none">
      <p class="lead text-2xl font-medium text-gray-900 mb-8">
        As business hubs like <strong>Zirakpur and Panchkula</strong> continue to expand at a rapid pace, the competition for corporate prestige and customer attention is at an all-time high. A flat, uninspired sign no longer cuts it. To truly establish authority, businesses are turning to high-quality 3D sign boards.
      </p>

      <p>
        At <strong>Classic Printing</strong>, we specialize in elevating brand identities through precision-crafted 3D lettering. We help businesses transition from "just another shop" to a premium brand destination.
      </p>

      <h2>The Corporate Standard in Panchkula & Zirakpur</h2>
      <p>
        Walk through the IT parks in Panchkula or the booming commercial plazas along the Zirakpur-Ambala highway. What do the most successful businesses have in common? Their signage reflects permanence. 
      </p>
      <p>
        3D signs offer a level of depth, texture, and professionalism that flat flex banners simply cannot match. For corporate offices, luxury showrooms, real estate developers, and high-end clinics, acrylic or steel 3D letters create an immediate sense of trust and established success.
      </p>

      <h2>Types of 3D Sign Boards We Manufacture</h2>
      <p>
        "3D Signs" is a broad category. At Classic Printing, we fabricate several premium variations to match your specific brand aesthetic:
      </p>

      <h3>1. Solid Stainless Steel & Brass Letters</h3>
      <p>
        The ultimate in luxury signage. We laser-cut high-grade stainless steel or brass to form solid, unlit 3D letters. These are incredibly popular for indoor reception areas and law firms in Panchkula where a subtle, highly polished, and authoritative look is desired.
      </p>

      <h3>2. Front-Lit Acrylic 3D Letters</h3>
      <p>
        These letters are constructed with opaque metal or PVC returns (sides) and a translucent acrylic face. Inside, we house ultra-bright LED modules. At night, the face of the letter glows vibrantly. This is the go-to choice for retail storefronts in Zirakpur's bustling markets.
      </p>

      <h3>3. Back-Lit / Halo Effect 3D Letters</h3>
      <p>
        For a sophisticated, modern aesthetic, we use opaque materials (like aluminum or steel) for the front and sides of the letter, and leave the back open with a clear acrylic spacer. The LEDs inside shine backward against the wall, creating a beautiful "halo" of light around the dark silhouette of the letter. 
      </p>

      <h2>Why Trust Classic Printing?</h2>
      <p>
        Fabricating a flawless 3D sign requires immense precision. 
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>Precision Routing & Laser Cutting:</strong> We use advanced CNC routers and laser cutters to ensure your brand's typography is perfectly replicated, down to the millimeter.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>Weatherproof Electronics:</strong> Outdoor 3D signs face heavy rain and intense heat. We use IP67-rated waterproof LED modules and heavy-duty power supplies so your sign never shorts out or loses its glow.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>Secure Installation:</strong> 3D letters are heavy. Our installation team uses heavy-duty mounting templates and commercial-grade structural adhesives to ensure your sign stays safely mounted to your facade, no matter the weather.
      </p>

      <div class="bg-blue-50 p-8 rounded-2xl border border-blue-100 my-12 text-center">
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-0 mb-4">Transform Your Office or Storefront Today</h3>
        <p class="mb-6">Ready to make a premium statement in Zirakpur or Panchkula? Contact Classic Printing for a custom 3D signage quote.</p>
        <a href="tel:7976169388" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-8 py-4 font-bold rounded-lg bg-neon-blue text-white hover:bg-gray-900 transition-colors no-underline">
          Call Us Now: 7976169388
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
